            "review_title": "Review at Blu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "bb1011\nSunderland, United Kingdom34 contributions\n0\nOur go-to for breakfast in Thao Dien\nMay 2023 • Couples\nWe travel to Thao Dien every year to visit family, and always choose Blu Bar for breakfast. Excellent quality, service and price, and we always get a friendly welcome from the owners, who speak good English.\nEspecially recommended: the Blu breakfast and avocado on toast with poached eggs. The two course lunch or dinner is also exceptional, both in taste and value.\nA great place to sit outside and enjoy a glass of wine or a cocktail in the evenings, watching the world go by!\nRead more\nWritten May 13, 2023",
