            "review_title": "Review at Blu Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Franz J\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nNew restaurant in Thao Dien near Riverside\nAug 2022\nNot entirely new, this is a reboot of the old Blu Bar & Grill which was located inside Riverside. The new manager is starting over in a new setting right next to the international school. The food is very good and the prices a bit cheaper. There are also a few other restaurants & bars next to it and it creates for a nice lively area in the evening. I had their famous chicken quasadillas, which is very generous and tasty, I recommend it. I chose a glass of red wine which happened to be a bit different that I expected (I am very picky about my wines), they immediately offered a different one not question asked.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 16, 2022",
